-- title:
--   RH height 14–100 — translation weights
-- statement:
--   Integer factorial-convolution weights and their two packed signed encodings for translating the global Xi polynomial to the height-14–100 local centers. These constants come from sometik179’s certificate construction. Their agreement with the factorial weight formula, no-carry bounds, and extracted convolution coefficients are proved by the main height-block proof; this module provides only ordinary literal definitions.
