--   sometik179, height-14–100 Lean certificate proof, Prove2Me submission c9908072-d99a-4431-aad8-a72c6352619a (2026-10-03), https://prove2.me/submissions/c9908072-d99a-4431-aad8-a72c6352619a. Theta/Mellin foundations attributed there to Gabewhigham, accepted submission 7ab19408-190a-439f-81f8-63e983ebb00b. Ordinary-syntax literal data preserved from the recovered export.

